       error = N*p - p = (N - 1) * p

   MAGNITUDE:

       tract    N ~ 1e4 :  error ~ 1e4 * p
       county   N ~ 1e6 :  error ~ 1e6 * p

   SIGNATURE:

       large positive number
       NOT a sentinel
       NOT a NaN
       NOT flagged by range check (unless tight)
       -->  SILENT against generic validity filters

   FAILURE MODE:

       T component  <--  C01 count instead of C03 share
       R aggregate  <--  inflated by 10^4 - 10^6
       sigma_R      <--  dominated by substituted cell
       B_H, S_k     <--  all downstream objects wrong
